      "title": "DVB-S2: Store whether low roll-off values are used in conversation data",
      "message": "DVB-S2: Store whether low roll-off values are used in conversation data\n\nIt's possible to have a capture that has multiple DVB-S2[X] streams\non different UDP or RTP ports that use different roll-off values.\nStore the information about whether we've transitioned into the\nlower roll-off range in conversation data instead of in a global.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-05-10T23:16:27.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
